                <mxCell id="p6_summary" value="Implementation Summary:&#10;&#10;3 new files: PeerCacheServer/Client, PeerCacheStorage, DecodeKVReplicator&#10;5 modified files: backend_factory, hiradix_cache, scheduler_output_processor_mixin,&#10;                  deploy_server, python_router, server_args&#10;Single master switch: --enable-peer-replication (deploy_server)&#10;Default OFF: zero overhead when disabled&#10;Zero inference latency impact when enabled (fully async replication)&#10;Both prefill and decode KV pages are replicated&#10;Recovery: seconds → milliseconds" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#1b5e20;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=3;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
